# Nibelheim Aflame, Flashback {5}{R}{R}: "If this spell was cast from a graveyard, discard your hand and draw four cards." Cast from
# the hand on turn 1 it hits only Bot1's own Ornithopter (1 damage from Memnite) and goes to the graveyard. On turn 5 a Black
# Lotus, Mox Ruby, Mox Jet, Mox Pearl and a Mountain pay the flashback exactly (7 mana, CR 702.34a): Bot2's
# Ornithopter may not be its target (it must be a creature Bot1 controls); with Memnite as the target it deals 1 damage to each
# other creature - Bot1's Ornithopter, Bot2's Ornithopter and Memnite, which dies - then Bot1 discards its hand (the Island it
# drew on turn 3) and draws four cards, and the spell is exiled.

